    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p1_b13",
      "text": "Instruction Tuning, Direct Preference Tuning) often exhibit an over-\nreliance on text, which leads to language bias. To counter this, we\npropose two distinct methods, Language Bias Regularization and\nLanguage Bias Penalty, which encourage the LVLM to balance\nits focus between visual and textual modalities during training.\n",
